      story: Gregory Spearslayer was born in a mountain clan, where balance, lungs,
        and stubborn legs mattered before formal schooling. As a child, Gregory Spearslayer
        lived through the night fishing runs, learning balance, cold patience, and
        hand strength before sunrise. As a young adult, Gregory Spearslayer worked
        through a noble challenge work, learning distance, witnesses, pride, and
        the price of public mistakes. They enter the dojo to make their name public.
